<title>CANADA: Aur Resources up on block trades.</title>
<headline>Aur Resources up on block trades.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aur Resources Inc was up in heavy block trading on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Shares in the Toronto-based metals producer were up C$0.25 to C$7.50 in early trading with most of the activity stemming from brokerage Research Capital Corp.</p>
<p>&quot;I'm a fan and I think the stock is cheap,&quot; said Research Capital analyst Manford Mallory.</p>
<p>But he said there was no big news today that prompted the heavy trading.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the company said Aur had not released any news recently, and did not expect to announce anything in the near future.</p>
<p>-- Heather Scoffield, Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8104</p>
